# Find the right source
@scenario office_lesson_27
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk notes]
pip: A producer points at a frame. You need to get from that moment to the line you can edit.
pip: Open this VNS beat, launch Puppeteer at the cursor, then return to the source before changing the line.
@label check
pip: What should you keep aligned while checking an edit?
> The cursor beat in the editor and the runtime scene state. -> correct
> Only the file modification time. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A different scene state can make an unchanged edit look wrong. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A different scene state can make an unchanged edit look wrong.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_27]
[flag tutorial_done_27]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
